---
title: Every question type
---

? Short answer {#short}
[text placeholder="Your answer" maxlength=80 pattern="[A-Za-z ]+"]

? Long answer {#long}
[paragraph minlength=10]

? Website
[url placeholder=https://example.com]

? Phone
[phone country=nl placeholder="06 12345678"]

? Age
[number min=0 max=130 step=1]

? Birthday
[date min=1900-01-01]

? Preferred time
[time]

? Favorite color
[radio shuffle]
- ( ) Red
- (x) Green
- ( ) Blue
- ( ) Something else: ___

? Toppings
[checkbox min=1 max=2]
- [x] Cheese
- [ ] Mushrooms
- [ ] Olives

? Country
[dropdown]
- Netherlands
- Canada
- Other country

? Rank these features
1. Dark mode
2. Offline sync
3. Export

? Overall
[rating 10]

? Availability
[checkbox-grid]
| | Morning | Afternoon |
|---|---|---|
| Monday | | |
| Tuesday | | |

? How do you feel about each proposal?
[grid]
| | Love it {yes} | Neutral {maybe} | Against {no} | N/A {na .muted} |
| Dark mode |
| Public API |

? Home address
[address]

? Delivery address
[address country=nl]

? Resume *
> PDF or Word, up to 5MB.
[file accept=".pdf,.docx" maxsize=5MB maxfiles=2]
